This package ports the Solana linkage signals and noisy-OR scorer from the
owner's proprietary `wallet-sleuth` repository into three.ws, under the
permission the owner grants themselves as the author of both repositories.
The original license grants and prohibitions on `wallet-sleuth` continue to
apply to this derived code:

