  - Modify or create derivative works beyond integrating it into three.ws.
  - Run, deploy, or host this source as a standalone product or service.
  - Use this source in another product.
  - Sell or sublicense this source.
  - Remove this notice.

This file exists to satisfy the wallet-sleuth license's requirement that its
notice travel with the ported code. It does not change three.ws's own
license for the rest of the monorepo.
